WEBVTT

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.770
That's a big elephant.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:18.350
Full, full, full.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.320
Full frontal.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.880
It's a pervert!

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:32.860
So you've come.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.540
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.810
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:54.750
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:11.270
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.340
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:24.950
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:32.620
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:37.330
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.230
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:44.530
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:50.210
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:54.610
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:57.850
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:03.990
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:09.960
Wilting Elephant!

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:12.630
Dear Dai Yoko.

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:14.730
Sekidousai.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:18.630
Who's he?

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:20.300
He knows that pervert?

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:21.740
You two.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.340
Don't move.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:26.410
Who the heck are you?

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:27.480
The police.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.480
Making fun of us?

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:30.110
Po-lice?

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:32.820
Those who take away our freedom.

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:35.620
In short, they're like constables.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.920
Telling me to go back under that rock?

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:42.490
In Japan, they tell you to persevere on a rock for 3 years.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:44.730
I was under one for 300 years.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:45.730
You're right.

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:47.700
- You guys.
- Enough!

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.330
Turn into a rock.

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.840
There you go.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.980
Now there's no need to hold back.

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.280
It's been a long time.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.250
You know, when I was sealed,

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.420
I was always thinking about you.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.980
Me too.

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:12.290
I wanted to have a go with you again.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.690
I couldn't forget those 3 days with you.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:20.500
Umm, you do realize somebody would misunderstand that, right?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.330
But, I feel the same.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:23.770
Hey, Sekidousai.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:25.900
I love you.

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:28.600
I hate you.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:31.310
Evil Blaze!

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:34.440
Blood of Sekidou, come.

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:40.380
This is so fun, Sekidousai.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.380
It is fun, Dai Yoko.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:43.820
Let's go.

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.860
I'm so glad you're serious about this.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:53.560
Otherwise, there's no point in getting revenge.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.700
Dad.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:00.340
Let's go.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.050
Evil Fire!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.820
Dad.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:22.290
Yoko!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:23.260
Stop it.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:27.600
If you don't stop,
I'm going to hate you, Dad!

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.080
Yoko.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.210
I'm fine.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.450
My love nest with Keita.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.120
My cute Aki.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.590
Worry about me, will you?

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.830
We will now split into two teams.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:04.570
Nadeshiko and I will go to
Sekidousai and Dai Yoko.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.340
We'll do what we can.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:10.840
The rest, evacuate as many people as you can.

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.880
Understood, Master Kaoru.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.280
Let's go, Nadeshiko.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.110
Yes.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.650
Let's go.

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:24.890
Purification Flash,
Manifestation x3. Crimson.

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:28.320
Dai Yoko's revival.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.530
His fight with Sekidousai.

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:34.500
Their aura has agitated the negative energies.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:37.500
By Master Kaoru's order, we the Inukami...

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.970
Shall be your opponent.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.940
It's dangerous here.

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:44.710
Take care.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:50.910
Now then.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.080
Shall we get going?

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.780
I'm sorry, Keita.

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.550
I dragged you into something troublesome.

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:00.460
When he's like that,
Dad can't be stopped.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.690
That's not your fault.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:05.890
If we beat Sekidousai, he'll be back to normal.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.130
Yeah.

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.040
Nadeshiko?

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.310
Excuse me.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:25.650
When I think back about your act just now.

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:29.690
I tried my best.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.850
You did great.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.090
I see.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:37.490
I can't let everyone see me and Sekidousai together.

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:41.260
This is a secret between you and me.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.630
Is this really okay?

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.840
It's fine.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:53.640
If we explain once it's over, everyone will surely understand.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:56.910
You're right.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:00.850
Let's hurry to Sekidousai.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:01.750
Let's go.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.750
Kaoru.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.190
Nadeshiko.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.920
Where are the others?

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:10.660
We're moving separately.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:14.130
They're evacuating the citizens.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:18.070
We're going to the same place then.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:20.270
With Kaoru, we're stronger than ever.

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:21.640
Let's beat up Sekidousai.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:24.640
What's wrong?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:30.610
I can't let them know what's between
Master Kaoru and Sekidousai.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:36.620
We're going to get a magic tool that can seal Sekidousai.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:40.820
A magic tool to seal Sekidousai?

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:42.120
That exists?

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.360
Yes. It's in his secret base.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.160
You know where his new secret base is?

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.400
So, I want you two to help.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.370
Help?

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:55.500
It's over for Sekidousai if we get that tool.

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.110
I heard it's hidden and heavily guarded.

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:02.580
That's why, I need your powers.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.850
Kaoru isn't going?

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:07.550
Sekidousai might realize what we're planning.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:10.820
If that happens,
Master Kaoru will hold him back.

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:14.220
I see, a dual-layered plan. Got it.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.060
That's the plan, yes?

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.060
Yeah.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.760
Master Kaoru, a moment.

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.370
Thanks. To be honest, I'm surprised.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.470
I was surprised too.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:28.070
Now, please go.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.040
Leave this to me.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.410
I'm sorry.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:38.180
Master Kaoru.

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:45.520
A tool to seal Sekidousai!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:48.620
It'll be a huge turnabout.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.190
Let's go.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:59.740
Sekidousai, this isn't what you promised.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.440
Just you wait, Sekidousai.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.910
Purification Flash.
Manifestation x All.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:12.350
Purgatory.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.080
For Master Kaoru...

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.290
We will fight!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:32.730
What are you doing?

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:34.340
Stop the act already.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:39.640
There's no such thing as a magic tool that can seal Sekidousai, right?

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.680
What are you saying?

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:43.650
Right?

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:46.950
Nadeshiko.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:48.950
That's right.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.620
No way. Why?

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.090
What are you and Kaoru planning?

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.190
Yoko?

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.090
Keita.

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:57.890
Go see Kaoru.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:58.630
Don't.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:00.760
Hurry.

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.260
Got it.

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:06.970
Nadeshiko, tell me everything.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.010
I can't.

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:12.710
Then... I'll make you.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:13.940
Evil Fire!

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:16.450
"Inukami!"

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.680
Woof woof.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:22.120
"Inukami!"

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:23.950
Woof woof.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:25.090
Evil Fire!

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:32.330
When you, who always hides behind
Kaoru, starts talking that much,

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:33.930
anybody would realize.

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:36.130
You really can't be underestimated.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.800
You really like Kaoru, don't you?

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.140
For Master Kaoru...

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:44.870
I will tell any lie.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:49.140
The reluctant Nadeshiko doing all this...

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.080
Evil Fire.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:55.620
Purification Flash. Manifestation x3.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:56.850
Crimson.

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:02.690
There's no end to this.

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:05.330
Tomohane, Imari, Sayoka, switch back.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:08.730
Igusa, Tayune, Gokyoya,
Tensou, Furano, form a circle.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.430
Yes.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:14.440
Purification Flash.
Manifestation x3. Crimson.

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:35.990
Kaoru.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:38.890
Keita.

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:42.460
What are you and Nadeshiko planning?

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.200
So the plan has failed.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:50.210
I'm going to protect Sekidousai.

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:51.210
Protect?

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.140
Sekidousai?

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:54.980
I'm going to help him.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.240
You've got to be kidding.

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:58.680
If you lay your hands on him.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.850
Even if it's you...

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:02.980
Kaoru.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.030
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.830
Frog, take me higher.

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:19.470
I'm surprised you and Nadeshiko sided with Sekidousai.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:22.070
Do the other Inukami know?

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:24.370
No, it's just me and Nadeshiko.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:25.810
You're so cruel.

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:27.280
Purification Flash...

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.150
I don't get it, but for your sake,

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:34.320
they swore their oath to you and trusted you.

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:37.090
You'll just use them and throw them away?

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:38.820
You'll betray them?

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.230
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:47.500
Frog, take my anger and crush!

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.340
Master Kaoru?

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.110
Master Keita?

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:02.110
Why are they fighting?

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:07.580
Keita.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:08.550
Master Kaoru.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:12.320
In the name of the wise Hakusan.
Frog, explode.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:16.560
This is for the Inukami you've betrayed.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:19.330
In the name of Tousan Shinkun.

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.600
Atmosphere, blow away his explosion.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:25.070
What?

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:34.540
Go, Kaoru.

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:37.580
But before that...

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.550
Apologize to them.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:52.690
Wait.

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:54.230
Tomohane.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.600
Teleport.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:10.710
Master Keita.

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:11.950
Are you okay?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:12.880
Yes.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.690
Kaoru.

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:20.860
Say something!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:43.580
Sekidousai, you didn't get rusty.
In fact, you're stronger.

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:49.350
You too. Seems like you weren't just sleeping all this time.

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.090
Sekidousai.

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:05.400
Purification Barrier Type 2.
Purple Pillar.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.910
An Inukami's nature is to vanquish evil.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:16.910
Our desire is to exterminate evils ravaging humans.

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:19.780
Right now, concentrate on that.

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:20.750
Yes.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.650
Dad.

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:24.890
Stop it.

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:26.960
Not bad, Sekidousai.

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:31.130
Seems like you weren't just sleeping for 300 years, either.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.400
Ho ho, but of course.

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:36.300
That old me is nothing compared to how I am now.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.800
I'm totally different from that time you beat me.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:43.310
85%

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:45.940
Master is so troublesome.

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:50.180
Though I do understand why he wants to compare powers with Dai Yoko.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:56.450
But, it's about time
I fight like a real mage.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.160
Real mages fight with girly dolls?

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:05.130
Be my power.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.170
He's turning big?

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:18.410
Dad!

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:23.750
You fool. You're the one who became smaller.

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:25.710
No way.

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:36.060
Too easy.

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:37.560
That's it?

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:41.000
That's all there is to it, Dai Yoko?

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:42.760
Dai Yoko is...

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:43.730
Dad.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:47.870
Amazing. He's amazing.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:52.570
Dai Yoko's power is throbbing and flowing inside me.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:53.010
100%

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:56.410
This power is amazing. It's so strong!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.580
Congratulations on achieving 100%
Pop. Congrats.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.750
Finally.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:02.550
I've finally reached 100%.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:08.360
Daisakkai is the ultimate magic tool that can grant any wish.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:11.260
I will use it and make my ideal world.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:15.800
Screw ethics, morals, and humanity.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.600
All desires shall be answered.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.000
It's a free world.

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.610
Turn Dad back!

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:28.680
You showed up,
Keita Kawahira and his pet dog.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:31.650
I have a debt with you guys.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.210
Causality.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:37.020
Bow down before me!

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:38.090
Yoko.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:41.520
Keita.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:52.100
Dai Yoko's skill is making you suffer.

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.770
How ironic.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.340
Stop it!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.510
Yoko.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.010
Help me.

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:05.050
Stop it. At this rate,
Keita will disappear.

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:08.520
Of course, that's what I intended.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:12.490
In the name of Tousan Shinkun.

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:15.060
Atmosphere, sing upon a symphony.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.100
Keita.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.800
Why did you get in my way,
Kaoru Kawahira?

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:29.270
You too. I'd rather you don't do anything unnecessary.

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:32.810
You're breaking our promise, hurting Keita and the others.

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:35.440
I will fulfill my promise with you.

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:37.280
Promise?

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:39.280
Daisakkai has revived.

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:42.520
I will grant you your wish.

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:46.490
But, I'm free to do other things.

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:50.790
How about cooling your head? Adios.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.230
Wait.

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:53.730
Master Kaoru.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.730
Master Kaoru!

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.770
Help me.

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:01.740
Keita.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.340
Are you all right?

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:10.850
Darn that Sekidousai.
Daisakkai has revived?

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:13.580
Even Kaoru betrayed us.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.180
Is that you, Yoko?

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.560
You came at a good time.
I have an important...

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:23.690
Don't look at him.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:26.790
Even for a pervert, that is bad.

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.630
I can hear you.

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.600
I'm not a pervert.

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:33.470
I'm not doing this because I want to.

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:34.600
Really?

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:35.640
Really.

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:37.640
This is Sekidousai's doing.

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:41.810
Because he tied me in this weird way, nobody would help.

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:45.380
I managed to escape somehow and got here by myself.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:46.610
Teleport.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:48.850
Thank you. By the way...

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:51.220
Could that baby be...

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:53.250
That's right, he's Keita.

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:56.020
He's so dramatic just like usual.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:02.660
More importantly, I saw an incredible thing at Sekidousai's secret base.

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:04.200
And I heard.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:07.200
About Kaoru Kawahira's secret.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.210
Kaoru's?

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.750
Master Kaoru, what is going on?

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.990
Master Kaoru, please explain.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:28.460
Don't you trust Master Kaoru?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.960
Believe Master Kaoru.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.030
But...

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:35.730
Are you going to look at your master with doubtful eyes?

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:39.000
I've had enough.

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:41.970
I can't take it anymore.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:42.740
Calm down.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:46.980
We saw what's in the villa's basement.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.220
Master Kaoru.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:58.190
I've caused trouble for everyone.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.120
Master Kaoru.

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:01.690
I'll tell you everything.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.860
Master Kaoru, what are you...

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.730
I'm...

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.900
Not the Kaoru Kawahira that you think.

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:15.140
Master Kaoru.

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:19.440
Nadeshiko, this is how it should be.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.180
I'm...

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:43.000
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:48.440
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:53.510
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:58.750
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:01.820
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:04.420
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.190
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:10.630
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:13.530
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:16.300
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:21.500
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:23.840
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:26.610
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:32.780
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.150 --> 00:22:35.480
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight.</i>

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:38.290
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:41.860
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:53.970
Inukami!

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:54.870
See you!

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:56.040
Next episode preview

00:22:56.040 --> 00:22:57.870
The time they laughed together.

00:22:57.870 --> 00:23:00.610
The seasonal sadness they experienced.

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:03.540
The truth they could not talk about

00:23:03.540 --> 00:23:06.550
is about to make them fall into the depths of fate.

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:09.720
The gap in their hearts from slight mistakes

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:13.120
is about to give birth to an irrevocable darkness.

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:17.660
Before they know it, it will cover the sky of Kichijitsu City.

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:19.260
Next on Inukami!

00:23:19.260 --> 00:23:21.330
"Kaoru and Nadeshiko!"

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:24.330
Together they think, therefore they are.
